  "title": "Yen Press Rascal Does Not Dream of Bunny Girl Senpai Light Novel Vol 1 English",
  "shortDescription": "The Yen Press \"Rascal Does Not Dream of Bunny Girl Senpai\" Light Novel Vol 1 in English is a single unit softcover book featuring the popular characters Mai Sakurajima and Sakuta Azusagawa. Written by Hajime Kamoshida and with cover art by Keji Mizoguchi, this light novel is part of a manga series targeted at children and young adults. Published by Yen Press, this color-combined edition is a must-have for fans of the series looking to immerse themselves in the enchanting world of Rascal and his dream of bunny girl senpai. Condition: The covers are good except in the front top there is a tiny scap. The spine and binding are good except there is a tiny bump on the book of it. The pages are good and the color is light yellow",
